    "text": "The number of solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is:",
