  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given trigonometric equation can be written as<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p>In given interval <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math> and these values are also satisfied by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence total number of solutions is <math><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
